# PDP story / long-form layout padding

On product detail pages, long-form story blocks (`.product-story`) must use the **same horizontal inset** as the top gallery/info block (`.product-detail`):

- Mobile: `1.25rem`
- Desktop (≥900px): `2rem`

Do not let story copy or media sit edge-to-edge while the upper PDP has padding. Apply the same rule to any future below-the-fold PDP sections that sit outside `.product-detail`.
